{"id":"maquillage","lemma":"maquillage","pos":"noun","rank":2722,"glosses":["makeup"],"ipa":"/ma.ki.jaʒ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/9e/Fr-maquillage.ogg/Fr-maquillage.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"maquillages"},"examples":[{"text":"Elle porte beaucoup de maquillage.","en":"She wears a lot of makeup.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"door"},{"g":"much, very much, a lot"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Elle utilise du maquillage pas cher.","en":"She uses cheap makeup.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"to use, to utilize","l":"utiliser"},{"g":"of the / some"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"dearly, expensively"}]},{"text":"Je ne porte pas de maquillage du tout.","en":"I don't wear makeup at all.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"door"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"of / from"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[6,8,"not at all"]]},{"text":"Même sans maquillage, elle est très mignonne.","en":"Even without makeup, she's very cute.","words":[{"g":"same"},{"g":"without"},null,{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"very"},{"g":"cute","l":"mignon"}]},{"text":"Certains hommes asiatiques mettent du maquillage.","en":"Some Asian men wear makeup.","words":[{"g":"certain, guaranteed","l":"certain"},{"g":"man","l":"homme"},{"g":"of Asia","l":"asiatique"},{"g":"to put","l":"mettre"},{"g":"of the / some"},null]}]}